# ICDL 2026 accepted-paper reproduction artifact — keep the tree limited to the paper's
# repro package (EDA + respiration + click-time analysis; see README). The items below are
# EXTRANEOUS to the accepted paper and are ignored so they can't be accidentally committed.
# They are LEFT ON DISK (untracked) — nothing here deletes or moves them; physical relocation
# is Tom's call.
#
# NOTE: .gitignore has no inline comments — every pattern is on its own bare line.

# macOS cruft
.DS_Store

# --- Extraneous EEG / future IEEE-TCDS-journal-extension material (the paper does not use EEG) ---
# ~1.6 GB raw/preprocessed EEG — never belongs in a code+preprocessed-data artifact:
data/EEG/
# zipped ARU archive (the paper ships the uncompressed ARU_*.csv/.json, which stay tracked):
data/ARU/*.zip
# MATLAB data caches (only the EEG timecourse .mat files exist; no paper .mat is tracked):
*.mat
# EEG-derived figures + caches (eeg_roi_*, eeg_timecourse*) — not paper figures:
results/eeg_*

# --- Extraneous CODE (EEG analysis + a journal-extension git helper) ---
# NOTE: these are source files with NO git backup once ignored — flagged for Tom to home in a
# separate/EEG repo (README already routes the EEG extended analysis to pce-sensitivity-dynamics).
code/analysis/plotEEGTimeCourse.m
code/analysis/plotEEGTimeCourse_clickless.m
code/analysis/regressARUfromEEG.m
code/preprocessing/preprocessEEGchannels.m
# helper scaffolding for the planned IEEE TCDS journal extension, not the poster:
git-workflow.sh
